{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_02",
  "title": "无寻处",
  "storyCode": "IW-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bc0247497e25460f19df06f48ac2fe4b9b26c2b2cdae567ee4300a93020e6c85",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“尚蜀山峦多栈道，峰回路转现长烟。”\n这块标牌突兀地杵在这里，标牌是新的，字是新的，只有标语是老的。\n而山是老的，石台阶是老的，索道和人，又都是新的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我摸了摸头，发梢并没有像想象中那般湿成一团。无法言说的感觉正如醍醐灌顶，浸染身心。\n所有清晰的关于白天的记忆都在迅速远去，可当你需要时，它们又会贴心地钻回脑海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我决定向上走。\n我也不知道为什么要向上走。哪怕我确信此刻左脚踩右脚就能触碰天空，我也选择了一步一个台阶地向上走。\n就像是响应诚意一般，又一块牌子出现在了栈道拐角。\n新的牌子，新的字，如同所有刻着到此一游的景区标牌那样。\n“攥江峰”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攥江峰......这是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——有人吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐隐的回音",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂......有人吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罢了，既来之则安之，既来之则安之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......远处好像有个亭子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怪了，我怎么记得在哪里见过......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个点不常有人来的，你要去那个亭子那儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不是......只是看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攥江峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚蜀三山十七峰之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是十八峰啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个亭子路很不好走的，也不知道是谁那么闲，在那儿建了个亭子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好像有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的啊，没人要亭子做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在这里扫雪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山顶没什么人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扫了雪才有人来呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁会来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天知道，你不就来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亭子里的人是不是在向你招手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多留意脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扫雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪天路滑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g02_yanalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......都在这里了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "师傅们不让我们掺和，大掌柜的又天天忙他的酒楼客栈，不想混吃等死的，都在这儿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "软弱的学徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不需要听郑......郑掌柜的，退一步行事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？听他的？听他的大家一起改行当厨师啦，还学什么武艺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他地方的物流公司，哪个不是风风火火的？大掌柜宁可改行开餐厅都不乐意打破那些规矩和物流公司竞争，我看他是老糊涂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "软弱的学徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在郑掌柜眼里，做餐饮生意也是正经买卖，可砸了招牌变成行裕物流，他是绝对不同意的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说为啥啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "软弱的学徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你问我，我哪知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郑老头这些年有多怕事，你我心知肚明。干镖局这么多年，临老了才悟过来，一辈子光得罪人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再这样下去，没人砸镖局招牌，镖局也一样会完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但这次，是笔和朝廷有关的大生意来着？故意搞砸，会不会有问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因为是大生意我才打算这么做，本小姐自然有分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的叫喊声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有贼！抓贼！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的叫喊声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让他跑了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......杜小姐，这也是你安排的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......当然不是！快跟去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g10_lianghouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的朋友好像都睡下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......时候其实不早了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是闲聊几句就到这个时辰了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那看戏的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说吧，你应该先养好身体，尽量别出门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照顾好自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总有些比身体抱恙还要紧的事，我才会特地出这趟门的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看戏吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我终归有公务在身，脱不开身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人这是在责备我游手好闲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "岂敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的叫喊声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有贼！抓贼！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......贼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真稀奇，梁府也能遭贼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先进屋去，我去看看怎么回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g10_lianghouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么情况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，梁大人，我也刚到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们是鲤的客人，也就是我的客人。让你们受惊，实在是有违待客之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁、梁大人，刚才我准备收工回家，突然看到墙上有个人影......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是，好像还抱着一只盒子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去鲤的房间，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位扫雪的姑娘说得没错，路确实难走。特别是我辛辛苦苦走上来，反而不见人影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你还在吗——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这里究竟是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要我来这里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是来......找你叙旧的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不了，没有悬念，算不得乐趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是给你带了件薄礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几十年而已，弹指一挥间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑白一对，如光影相生，阴阳调和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你选一只吧，另一只，我便自己留着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？不喜欢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕，也不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，只是大势所迫罢了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......刚才那是......梦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还没到睡个觉就会出事的年纪......怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鲤先生，刚才有人说看见了小偷，抱着与您那只相同的匣子飞檐走壁逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "匣子不见了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说那只酒盏啊......没事，在我这呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放匣子里的是我刚才顺手从橱柜上顺下来的普通茶壶，拿墨水染了个漆黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还没有傻到明知有人盯上这玩意，还不留个心眼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鲤先生真如同克洛丝恩人所说，一颗七窍玲珑心，绝无纰漏啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能为了这一只破古董就招惹一城知府，如果天底下的贼都是这个态度，近卫局只用等在煎饼摊前就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西到底什么来历？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该告诉你的，我会告诉你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这也是我要拜托你的第二件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到它的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原来如此。确实是个用得着侦探的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过在此之前......乌有兄，你的克洛丝恩人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......难、难道追出去了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（一路追到这里......但这里的夜市也太热闹了点吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（竟然跟丢了吗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（总之选个方向试探一下......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你是，白天的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是不是我说“不关我事”，也没用了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还什么都没说呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "换位思考一下嘛，刚到尚蜀，就碰上有人抢劫自己的朋友，还连抢两次，说是巧合你信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我也可以听你狡辩两句就是啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是多说无益了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g02_yanalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去这边看看。你往那边走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！劳烦鲤兄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢着，乌有兄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......脚边那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？什么也没有啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......似乎只是我眼花了，大概是什么宠物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
